{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A broken world. A forgotten legacy. A forge reignited</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Step into the glass-stained light of Lumina, a third-person action-adventure set in a world where ancient technology, steampunk relics, and medieval ruins collide. As Lumina, a young blacksmith whose origins were buried long ago, you\u2019ll traverse breathtaking lands shaped by the elemental power of <i>Red, Green, and Blue.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What remains of the kingdom lies in silence \u2014 overtaken by a mysterious usurper queen whose origins are as twisted as the ruins she commands. With nothing but your skill at the forge, you must uncover the past, restore the future, and awaken the magic within the stained glass halls of history. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724370/extras/e721802f6af23bbee3031f46975b395e.poster.avif?t=1772807236\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724370/extras/e721802f6af23bbee3031f46975b395e.webm?t=1772807236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724370/extras/e721802f6af23bbee3031f46975b395e.mp4?t=1772807236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Vast Realms \u2013 One Hidden Truth</strong><br>Venture through the <i>Red, Green, and Blue</i> worlds, each with distinct biomes, secrets, and challenges \u2014 all intricately connected through the energy that binds them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color-Based Combat System</strong> <br>Master weapons infused with <i>RGB energy</i>. Learn to match and strategize around color-based mechanics to overcome enemies and environmental puzzles.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Heir to the Forge</strong> <br>Uncover Lumina\u2019s forgotten lineage as she shapes the tools that will determine the fate of the realm. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Stained Glass &amp; Shadow</strong> <br>From fog-laden valleys to towering stained-glass cathedrals, explore a world shaped by minimal silhouettes, vivid reflections, and the scattered fragments of a once-whole realm.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Original Soundtrack</strong> <br>Lose yourself in a rich, emotional score crafted to elevate the atmosphere, mystery, and grandeur of Lumina\u2019s journey. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724370/extras/c375cd832db08524e5f2b72dc1cdb08a.poster.avif?t=1772807236\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724370/extras/c375cd832db08524e5f2b72dc1cdb08a.webm?t=1772807236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724370/extras/c375cd832db08524e5f2b72dc1cdb08a.mp4?t=1772807236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724370?t=1772807236","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724370/66e5dfc3b7df1e0fd86fda9be12fdcee34abc088/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772807236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724370/c30dd83857fbcafb9a12c90a6dffbc856d01a8e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772807236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724370/c30dd83857fbcafb9a12c90a6dffbc856d01a8e3